{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/06/9929125/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お久しぶりでそ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぼくでそっ！\nしろくまのろくちゃんでそ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなーっあけおめことよろー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飼い主さんのメガネ掛けてみたぜお！\nどんなもんだいっ\nぶりてぃっしゅぅぅぅうう！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/06/9929125/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"( ↑ドヤ顔 )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日、飼い主さんは今年初の\n握手会だったみたいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても楽しそうで、ぼくも嬉しかったです（＾ω＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうって感謝していたので、\nぼくもみんなに感謝したいです(*^_^*)てへへ\nちなみにそんなぼくには嫁がいます。名前はヨメです！！！！(爆)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/06/9929125/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"( ↑ニヤケ顔 )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで、みなさま本日は\nありがとうございました～＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっごく楽しかったです♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"２０１３年、良いスタートがきれました！\n素敵な時間をありがとお～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レーン一緒だった、ねねころも\nありがとう^ ^"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/06/9929125/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねねだいすき～っ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/06/9929125/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねねは俺のヨメ！！！（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねねころ部の部員のみなさまも\nありがとうございました ＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/06/9929125/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は、個別握手会っ(*^_^*)！\n久しぶりに５部すべて出させて頂きますっ！たのしみっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/06/9929125/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は、......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初の試みをしてみようと思うぜお！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではっ おやすみなさゆにゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/06/9929125/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/06/9929125/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/06/9929125/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/06/9929125/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんヽ(｡･ω･｡)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/06/9929125/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/06/9929125/0012.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}